# What a Docker build from this folder leaves out (apps/renderer/Dockerfile, also built from the
# platform's deploy with this folder as its context). The image installs its own dependencies:
# node_modules from the machine that builds (another pnpm store) would make that install fail.
**/node_modules
.git
.wrangler
**/dist
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
bench/local
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/android
.dev.vars
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.claude
.kilo
.zcode
.neon
